{
    "title": "Zenni - Eyewear for Everyone",
    "description": "With our app, you now have the widest selection of affordable, high-quality eyewear at your fingertips. Explore thousands of styles starting at just $6.95, including basic prescription lenses. Finding the perfect pair of prescription glasses or sunglasses has never been easier\u2014or more fun! Found a glasses style that you like? Find a similar pair with our AI-Powered Image Search Tool. Take a pic or upload a photo and find the Zenni frame that matches the style. Use our enhanced 3D Virtual Try-On to see how they look on you before you buy.  You can also shop for eyewear accessories and specialty lenses such as progressives, bifocals, Blokz\u00ae blue-light-blocking, and more.  \r\n\r\n<strong>Exclusive to App </strong>\r\n\u2022\tPersonalized shopping experience  \r\n\u2022\tSpecial offers and promotions\r\n\u2022\tEnhanced Virtual Try-On\r\n\u2022\tAI-Powered Image Search Tool\r\n\r\n<strong>Customized Style </strong>\r\n\u2022\tExplore thousands of frames to find a pair (or two!) that is uniquely you\u00a0\r\n\u2022\tSave your favorites with one click  \r\n\u2022\tGet the same quality lens options for one tenth the price of traditional retail\u00a0\r\n\u2022\tChoose from more than 20 tint options, including mirrors and polarized lenses, for chic prescription sunglasses starting at $12\u00a0\r\n\u2022\tDiscover our star-studded collaborations\r\n\u2022\tShop all the accessories you need, from chains and deluxe cases to cleaning kits\r\n\r\n<strong>Zenni Rewards</strong>\r\n\u2022\tEnroll and start earning exclusive rewards \r\n\u2022\tTrack your status\r\n\r\n<strong>Customer Care</strong>\r\n\u2022\tEnjoy hassle-free 30-day returns\r\n\u2022\tStore prescriptions for the whole family\r\n\u2022\tManage your orders and payment methods\r\n\u2022\tNeed help? Access chat or Help Center instantly",
    "descriptionHTML": "With our app, you now have the widest selection of affordable, high-quality eyewear at your fingertips. Explore thousands of styles starting at just $6.95, including basic prescription lenses. Finding the perfect pair of prescription glasses or sunglasses has never been easier\u2014or more fun! Found a glasses style that you like? Find a similar pair with our AI-Powered Image Search Tool. Take a pic or upload a photo and find the Zenni frame that matches the style. Use our enhanced 3D Virtual Try-On to see how they look on you before you buy.  You can also shop for eyewear accessories and specialty lenses such as progressives, bifocals, Blokz\u00ae blue-light-blocking, and more.  <br><br><strong>Exclusive to App </strong><br>\u2022\tPersonalized shopping experience  <br>\u2022\tSpecial offers and promotions<br>\u2022\tEnhanced Virtual Try-On<br>\u2022\tAI-Powered Image Search Tool<br><br><strong>Customized Style </strong><br>\u2022\tExplore thousands of frames to find a pair (or two!) that is uniquely you\u00a0<br>\u2022\tSave your favorites with one click  <br>\u2022\tGet the same quality lens options for one tenth the price of traditional retail\u00a0<br>\u2022\tChoose from more than 20 tint options, including mirrors and polarized lenses, for chic prescription sunglasses starting at $12\u00a0<br>\u2022\tDiscover our star-studded collaborations<br>\u2022\tShop all the accessories you need, from chains and deluxe cases to cleaning kits<br><br><strong>Zenni Rewards</strong><br>\u2022\tEnroll and start earning exclusive rewards <br>\u2022\tTrack your status<br><br><strong>Customer Care</strong><br>\u2022\tEnjoy hassle-free 30-day returns<br>\u2022\tStore prescriptions for the whole family<br>\u2022\tManage your orders and payment methods<br>\u2022\tNeed help? Access chat or Help Center instantly",
